WEBVTT

00:04:29.196 --> 00:04:31.195
and it gets a little tiring at times.

00:04:31.688 --> 00:04:35.182
But if there is one thing
that you taught me, it's resilience.

00:04:35.919 --> 00:04:40.207
I remember that you went to Mexico City
every day for 30 years

00:04:40.231 --> 00:04:42.152
to get money for the family.

00:04:42.176 --> 00:04:46.128
And I know that Abuelito
has been going out for 20 years

00:04:46.152 --> 00:04:49.572
to protect sacred land from big companies
that want to take it.

00:04:50.081 --> 00:04:51.485
A year is nothing

00:04:51.509 --> 00:04:54.437
compared to the struggles
that our family has been through.

00:04:54.855 --> 00:04:58.109
And if our struggles
make the world a better place,

00:04:58.133 --> 00:05:00.304
they will make us better people.